00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:39.940
The most common mistake is treating the glacial lake as a static feature and simply extending the 200-year floodplain.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:49.060
The fix is to add a scenario-based outburst volume to the hydraulic model and re-evaluate receptor exposure before submitting the final report.

